---
description: Privacy and data-safety rules (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use synthetic data only (`pnpm seed:synthetic`). Never use or request real FAS client records. Never connect to production.
- Shared outputs (board views, exports, anything a funder could see) are county-level only. No addresses, no exact dates (use month or quarter).
- Suppress any count below 11 and apply complementary suppression so hidden cells can't be recovered from totals. Use helpers in lib/metrics/suppression.ts; don't reimplement.
- Do not add fields for clinical notes, diagnoses, substance-use treatment, or court documents. Store only the fact and date of a court order.
- Every new table: RLS enabled, deny by default, explicit policies per role (admin, staff, board_viewer).
- No secrets in code, fixtures, logs or screenshots.
